SwapAndAddTest
├── when the pool hook has a returns-delta permission
│ └── it reverts with {UnsupportedHookPermissions}
├── when route is empty
│ └── it sizes from the pulled budgets
├── when route is non-empty
│ └── it overwrites budgets from post-route balances
├── when liquidityOptimistic is 0 AND deployTokenId is 0
│ └── it reverts with {InsufficientLiquidity}
├── when post-trim liquidity LT minLiquidity
│ └── it reverts with {InsufficientLiquidity}
└── given the op succeeds
    └── it leaves the zap idle (no pool tokens, no ETH)
